WEBVTT

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:08.080
(FIREWORKS POP, SQUEAL)

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:12.400
(CHEERING)
Come on, come on. Let's go.

00:00:12.440 --> 00:00:15.040
Woo-hoo-hoo!
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.080
(LAUGHS)
Whoa! Yeah!

00:00:18.120 --> 00:00:19.720
Otto?

00:00:24.160 --> 00:00:26.440
Otto!
Ye-ha!

00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.760
Otto!
Ye-ha! Ye-ha!

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:33.680
Otto! It's Mini-Boss!

00:00:33.720 --> 00:00:35.680
(GASPS)
Ah! Mini-Boss!

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.640
(CHEERS AND LAUGHS)
Mini-Boss!

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:39.680
Otto!

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:41.840
(LAUGHTER)

00:00:41.880 --> 00:00:44.400
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (LAUGHS)

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:45.520
(GASPS)

00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:48.920
You found the stone? Otto!
I'm so proud of you!

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:51.120
(GIGGLES COYLY)

00:00:51.160 --> 00:00:54.160
All right, we don't have much time.
We got to get this to Wild Knuckles.

00:00:54.200 --> 00:00:55.640
OK, OK.
(GASPS)

00:00:55.680 --> 00:00:57.240
Get him!

00:00:57.280 --> 00:00:59.040
(HEAVENLY TONE)
(GASPS)

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.920
Ya-ya-ya-ya-ya-ya-ya-ya!

00:01:01.960 --> 00:01:04.120
(SCREAMS) (PANTS)

00:01:04.160 --> 00:01:06.680
(ROPE SWOOSHES) (SCREAMS)

00:01:06.720 --> 00:01:09.440
Long time no see, punk!

00:01:09.480 --> 00:01:12.160
Aah! Oh!
(WHIMPERS)

00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:14.080
I'll take that!
(GROANS)

00:01:14.160 --> 00:01:16.040
(LAUGHS)

00:01:16.080 --> 00:01:18.160
(SIRENS WAIL)

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:19.400
Yes!

00:01:19.440 --> 00:01:21.200
(TYRES SCREECH)

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:23.120
(GRUNTS)
Don't move! Right there! Freeze!

00:01:23.160 --> 00:01:26.400
Anti-Villain League!
You are under arrest.

00:01:26.440 --> 00:01:28.560
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (CHUCKLES)

00:01:30.960 --> 00:01:33.280
Whoa, whoa, whoa. Everybody!

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.440
Did you forget what time it is?

00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:37.480
(CLOCK STRIKES, CHIMES)

00:01:37.520 --> 00:01:39.440
(CLICK) (MYSTICAL WHIRRING)

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:43.160
(WHOOSHES)

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:47.320
(EXPLOSIONS)

00:01:48.880 --> 00:01:52.400
Happy New Year!
(LAUGHS MENACINGLY)

00:01:54.160 --> 00:01:55.920
(PUBLIC SCREAM)

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.680
Fire!
(LASERS POP)

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:01.800
(ROARS)

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:06.160
(CRUNCHING)
(GIGGLES)

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:07.880
(IMPACT THUD) (GROANS)

00:02:08.760 --> 00:02:10.120
(LAUGHS WICKEDLY) (GROWLS)

00:02:12.680 --> 00:02:14.480
(GROWLS)

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:16.000
(CLAWS CLINK)

00:02:16.040 --> 00:02:17.680
(SPEAKS MINIONESE) (GROANS)

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:20.160
Stand your ground!
(LASERS POP)

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:22.640
(INDISTINCT SHOUTING)

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:26.320
(ROARS)

00:02:26.360 --> 00:02:27.600
(SCREAMS)

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:30.400
(FRANTIC SCREAMING, SHOUTING)

00:02:30.440 --> 00:02:32.000
(LAUGHS WICKEDLY)

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.280
(EFFORT GRUNTING)

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:36.160
Oh, no, no, no, no,
no, no, no, no, no, no, no!

00:02:36.200 --> 00:02:37.600
(CHUCKLES)
(IMPACT THUD)

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.800
Where do you think you're going?
Hmm?

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:43.440
You stole from us!
And now you're gonna pay!

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:45.160
(SCREAMS)

00:02:46.160 --> 00:02:47.320
(CLOCK STRIKES)
(WHIMPERS)

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.200
(THEY PANT)

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:52.120
(LAUGHS WICKEDLY)
Enjoy being torn apart!

00:02:52.160 --> 00:02:54.800
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:02:54.880 --> 00:02:56.040
Guys!

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:59.400
Oh.
Why don't we make this a fair fight?

00:02:59.440 --> 00:03:01.120
(LAUGHS)

00:03:01.160 --> 00:03:02.560
(POOF)

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:03.920
(GIGGLES)

00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.120
(POOF)

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:06.680
(GIGGLES)
(POOF)

00:03:07.800 --> 00:03:09.320
(CLUCKS)

00:03:09.360 --> 00:03:12.160
Oh! You thought I was serious!
(LAUGHS)

00:03:12.200 --> 00:03:14.040
Run!

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.840
(SCREAMS)
(BOOM)

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.520
No!
(WHIMPERS)

00:03:22.320 --> 00:03:24.960
Hello, traitors!
(GASPS)

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:26.800
Remember me?

00:03:28.360 --> 00:03:29.560
You!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:33.320
You can leave me for dead,
you can destroy everything I own,

00:03:33.360 --> 00:03:35.960
but I will not
let you hurt that kid!

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.840
Oh! So, you're gonna save the kid?
(LAUGHS)

00:03:38.880 --> 00:03:40.920
Yeah, you and what army?

00:03:40.960 --> 00:03:43.240
(SPEAKS MINIONESE)

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:46.920
OK. This army.
(GROWLS)

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:49.000
(LOW GROWLING)

00:03:51.200 --> 00:03:52.360
(GROWLS)

00:03:52.400 --> 00:03:55.520
(HISSES)
(GROWLS)

00:03:57.440 --> 00:04:01.200
(VOCALISE IN MINIONESE)

00:04:01.240 --> 00:04:03.480
(CLUCKS)

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:06.640
(CLOCK STRIKES)
(SCREAMS)

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:08.720
(SCREAMS)

00:04:14.760 --> 00:04:17.640
(MINION WHIMPERING)
(GROWLS)

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:19.600
(WHOOSH)
(SCREAMS)

00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:20.920
(IMPACT THUD)

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:23.680
(PANICKED CLUCKING)

00:04:25.920 --> 00:04:27.760
(HISSES)
(CLUCKS)

00:04:27.800 --> 00:04:29.920
(CLOCK STRIKES)
(SCREAMS)

00:04:29.960 --> 00:04:32.000
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:35.640
(SNARLS)
(WHIMPERS)

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:38.280
(SCREAMS)

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:41.880
(PANICKED WHIMPERING)

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:43.520
(LOW GROWLING)

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:49.240
'Dig down deep!
Find your inner beast!'

00:04:49.280 --> 00:04:51.760
(ROARS)

00:04:52.960 --> 00:04:56.240
(ZOOMS)

00:04:56.280 --> 00:04:58.680
(YELLS)

00:05:00.960 --> 00:05:02.280
(YELLS)

00:05:02.320 --> 00:05:03.640
(THUD)

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:06.640
(ROARS)

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:09.800
(IMPACT GROAN)

00:05:09.840 --> 00:05:11.400
(GRUNTS)
(MINION WHIMPERS)

00:05:11.440 --> 00:05:13.360
(SCREAMS)

00:05:13.400 --> 00:05:14.880
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:05:14.920 --> 00:05:16.920
(SPLAT)
(IMPACT GRUNTS)

00:05:16.960 --> 00:05:18.400
(TAIL SQUEAKS)
(HISSES)

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:19.480
(EGG PLOPS)

00:05:21.840 --> 00:05:24.360
(CRACK)
(SPEAKS MINIONESE EXCITEDLY)

00:05:24.400 --> 00:05:26.960
Mm-mmm.
(GRUNTS) (SLURPS)

00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:28.600
(SCREAMS)

00:05:28.640 --> 00:05:30.400
(IMPACT SPLAT) (ALL SCREAM)

00:05:30.440 --> 00:05:33.200
Ah!
(CHICK CLUCKS SWEETLY)

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:36.640
(GROANS)
(YELLING)

00:05:38.880 --> 00:05:41.120
(PANICKED YELLING)

00:05:41.160 --> 00:05:42.800
Coming!

00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:44.880
(CLOCK STRIKES) (PAINED YELLING)

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.920
(PANICKED CHUNTERING)

00:05:52.880 --> 00:05:54.160
(PANICKED GROANING)

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:57.040
(SNAP)
(ANGRY GROANING) (MUNCHING)

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:59.480
(PANICKED MINIONESE)

00:05:59.520 --> 00:06:00.920
(GROWLS)

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:02.000
(PAINED WHIMPERING)

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:04.360
(EFFORT GRUNTING)

00:06:04.400 --> 00:06:05.800
Otto!

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:09.000
Hurry! Faster!
(EFFORT GRUNT)

00:06:09.920 --> 00:06:12.000
(SCREAMS)
(ROARS)

00:06:12.040 --> 00:06:13.760
(INFLATES)

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:15.480
(GROWLS)
(THUD)

00:06:16.360 --> 00:06:19.000
No, no, no, no...
(SCREAMS)

00:06:19.040 --> 00:06:20.160
Gotcha.

00:06:20.200 --> 00:06:22.480
(WHIMPERING)

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.160
Go, go, go!

